            (at 355.6 239.395 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.15 1.15) ) )
            (uuid "de2d9418-4820-5430-b4d0-c6d52fad4e96"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 17.78 190.5) (xy 299.72 190.5))
            (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none))
            (uuid "661128f5-97b5-5a63-b564-80da5af3cf88"))
	(text "ASSEMBLY / MEASUREMENT NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 196.215 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left))
            (uuid "aeda9309-0d06-507a-9716-6b91ad030a23"))
	(text "1. Passive DUT only. Disconnect PoE and all active Ethernet equipment before connecting the VNA." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 203.2 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "66c71219-aae6-5868-a25c-3212376bcce9"))
	(text "2. Two identical PCB artworks; measure one path at a time and terminate all six unused SMA ports with 50 ohm loads." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 208.28 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "1f504dba-8587-5e20-8d9d-2a2fe2e2d635"))
	(text "3. RCT1..RCT4 are DNP on this board. The default comparison condition is CT-FLOAT on both endpoint boards." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 213.36 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "f4923a66-2d81-5417-a7d9-6ebd7c80939e"))
	(text "4. CT-GND is a separate controlled comparison: fit all eight RCTs across two boards; do not mix CT states." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 218.44 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "d316cf34-2b08-578f-9abe-0c1737b5487a"))
	(text "5. This common CAD keeps RSH1 and CSH1 DNP. Final PCBA variants follow PCBA_PURCHASE_SCOPE_2026-09-03.md." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 223.52 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "498763d9-8e71-5585-9421-5348a839a313"))
	(text "6. RSH1 fitted = direct shield bond; CSH1 alone = optional AC bond; both DNP = floating. Never fit both together." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 228.6 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "cb363594-6ab8-56b5-b091-608b4f8e9ca7"))
	(text "7. Final shield variants are assembled by the supplier; legacy hand-fit property text is not a user soldering instruction." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 233.68 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "eecd1730-83fa-57eb-9c09-aca7b22408c1"))
	(text "8. Coax O/S/L + THRU calibration leaves the PCB / balun response embedded. Keep REF/DUT fixture conditions fixed." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 238.76 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "ac9e277b-53a9-50c5-8f8d-6510d3a5cc36"))
	(text "9. Secondary convention P=pin 4, N=pin 6 is unchanged. Account for single-fixture polarity in phase/de-embedding work." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 243.84 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "68d90feb-171b-5d60-b998-5705cff25990"))
	(text "10. No TVS, common-mode choke, MagJack, series capacitors or on-board 50 ohm loads are added to the signal paths." (exclude_from_sim no)
            (at 20.32 248.92 0)
            (effects (font  (size 1.45 1.45) ) (justify left))
            (uuid "28cca6da-de51-5192-a699-ed1aaf29e2ff"))
